---
/**
 * 公司介绍页（信任页）。
 * 内容来源：qingdao-qianhui-company-profile.md（集团简介 PDF 转录）。
 * 口径：只写资料里有的数字；营销话术（如"30 年零投诉"）不转写。
 * 证书与奥运订单都按"这是公司自述文件"处理，不延伸成产品性能承诺。
 */
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProductGallery from '@/components/ProductGallery.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
import { pageTitle } from '@/lib/seo';
import { breadcrumbSchema, organizationSchema } from '@/lib/schema';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
  { name: 'Company', path: '/company/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle('About the Factory')}
  description="Qingdao Qianhui Home Textile Group: founded 1987, a 40,000 m² plant in Jimo District, Qingdao, and hotel bedding supplier to the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games."
  jsonld={[breadcrumbSchema(crumbs), organizationSchema()]}
>
  <div class="container-page py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Company' }]} />
  </div>

  <article class="container-page max-w-3xl pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">{SITE.legalName}</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      Hotel textiles made in Qingdao since 1987, sold wholesale to properties and distributors
      outside China.
    </p>

    <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-line sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="bg-white p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-600">Founded</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">1987</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-600">Plant</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">40,000 m²</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-600">Group companies</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">Six</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-600">Olympic order</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">2008</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">What this site sells, and what it does not</h2>
      <p>
        The group has six operating companies. Three of them are textile businesses, and the
        others work in medical devices, bottled water and beer. None of that last group is on
        this website.
      </p>
      <p>
        Here you can buy hotel sheets, duvet covers, pillowcases, towels, bathrobes, slippers,
        mattress protectors and mattresses. If your construction is outside what we run, we will
        say so rather than quote around it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Bed linen, towels and bathrobes are made at the Jimo plant. Mattresses are made by specialist
        mattress factories that build to our specification, and they are sold under the same
        order, contract and warranty as the rest of the range. The test reports are issued to
        those plants; ask for the PDFs with the quote and the holder's name is on each one.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">The six companies</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">Qingdao Qianhui Embroidery Co., Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">Embroidery and jacquard work, including the Olympic order described below.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">Qingdao Qianhui Trading Co., Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">The group's trading arm.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">E.S.bu.Textile (Bangladesh) Co., Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">A textile company in Dhaka.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">Qingdao Huawei Medical Devices Co., Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">Outside textiles.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">
            Qingdao Qianhui Wuqishan Medical Stone Water Industry Co., Ltd.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm">Outside textiles.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="font-medium text-ink-900">Qingdao Qingdeli Beer Co., Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">Outside textiles.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">The 2008 Beijing Olympics order</h2>
      <p>
        In 2008, Qianhui Embroidery was the designated hotel bedding supplier for the Beijing
        Olympic Games, and was authorised by the International Olympic Committee as an Olympic
        licensed product supplier.
      </p>
      <p>
        What that proves is that the company could deliver hotel bedding in volume, to a
        deadline, under inspection. What it does not prove is that the duvet cover you order
        now is the same construction that was supplied then. The Olympic order is a document in
        the vendor file. Your specification is a separate document, and the current one is the
        one that counts.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">The plant and the price list</h2>
      <p>
        The plant covers more than 40,000 m² in Jimo District, Qingdao. Fixed assets are listed
        at RMB 260 million. Our current hotel price list runs to 59 SKUs, from flat sheets to
        mattresses.
      </p>
      <p>
        Those numbers answer the questions on a vendor form. They say less about a particular
        order than the GSM of the towel you are buying, which is why the specifications live on
        the product pages instead of being repeated here.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm">
        <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/hotel-bedding-supplier/">Bedding supplier</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-ink-600">·</span>
        <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/hotel-mattress-supplier/">Mattress supplier</a>
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4">
        <ProductGallery images={['company-plant', 'company-workshop']} />
      </div>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Certifications</h2>
      <p>
        Qianhui Embroidery, the manufacturing company, holds ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015 and
        ISO 45001:2018 certificates issued by Xingyuan Certification Centre on 7 July 2025 and
        valid to 6 July 2028. It also holds China Environmental Label certification for direct
        contact and non-direct-contact textile products, valid to 11 May 2028.
      </p>
      <p>
        None of these is a product fire test. For a US mattress the document that matters is a
        16 CFR 1633 report. We hold SGS report SDFTS25002706R05_EN for a pocket-spring
        prototype; it was issued to the mattress factory, not to Qianhui, and the page linked
        below says which sizes it covers. If your vendor file needs the originals, ask for them
        with the quotation.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm">
        <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/certifications/">Certifications and test reports</a>
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Awards, and how much they are worth</h2>
      <p>
        The group holds a run of provincial and municipal titles: Shandong Famous Trademark,
        Shandong Famous Brand, AAA Credit Enterprise, China Inspection Exemption Enterprise,
        Qingdao Top 100 Scientific and Technological Private Enterprises, and Qingdao Top Ten
        Enterprises with Brand Influence.
      </p>
      <p>
        They carry weight in Chinese procurement and less outside it. We list them here because
        buyers compiling a vendor file ask for them, not because a provincial award tells you
        anything about the thread count of a sheet.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Where we are</h2>
      <p>
        <span class="font-medium text-ink-900">Head office and plant:</span>
        {SITE.contact.address}.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-medium text-ink-900">Bangladesh:</span> E.S.bu.Textile (Bangladesh)
        Co., Ltd., House 40, Road 7, Sector 3, Uttara Model Town, Dhaka 1230, Bangladesh.
      </p>
      <p>
        Orders for this site are quoted from Qingdao. The Bangladesh company is a separate
        legal entity in the group; if your programme is in South Asia, ask which entity the
        order will be invoiced from.
      </p>
      <p>
        Email <a class="font-semibold underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.contact.email}`}>{SITE.contact.email}</a>.
        The same number takes WhatsApp and calls: <a
          class="font-semibold underline"
          href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.contact.whatsapp}`}
        >{SITE.contact.phone}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Put a room count against it</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600">
        Send the property type, the bed sizes, and the month you need the goods. We will reply
        with what we can make to your spec and what we would substitute.
      </p>
      <a href="/request-a-quote/" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
        Request a quote
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
